    IsometricSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 253436c829cd64344b0e379ec2fe8683, type: 3}
  - Descriptive:
      Id: RenaissanceNativeAmericanTomahawk
      ArtifactName: Medieval Native American Tomahawk
      Description: After the arrival of European, tomahawks began to be tipped with
